1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,200
Where am I? You are in the house of Elrond.

2
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:15,120
And it is ten o'clock in the morning,
on October the 24th, if you want to know.

3
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,080
Gandalf! Yes, I'm here.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,730
And you're lucky to be here, too.

5
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:30,800
A few more hours, and we would
have been beyond our aid.

6
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,760
What happened, Gandalf?

7
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:40,200
Why didn't you meet us?

8
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:42,740
Oh, I am sorry, Frodo.

9
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,000
I was delayed.
